WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.791
We tested a six dollar supermarket bag
against a twenty four dollar specialty
bag, blind, with eleven people.

00:00:06.791 --> 00:00:14.827
Seven picked the cheap one. Not because it
was better coffee, but because it was
roasted darker and they were used to that
taste.

00:00:14.827 --> 00:00:22.490
The lesson is not that price is fake. It
is that your palate is trained, and you
can retrain it. Start with a medium roast.
